notes.content:
List of changes 1.1.1:
- Completely changed the inventory system. Now it is divided into 3 parts: equipment, weapons and items;
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38793302/811e2750cd44596fc34f6e35d2ba6ba3f4661e2f.png[/img]
- Added 2 slot for the main weapon, now the player can have 1 pistol and 2 any other types of weapons in quick access;
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38793302/8fc58f81814a7acd2b31841c9371f16bcd56c001.png[/img]
- Removed helmet slot;
- Item sizes removed, now each item takes 1 slot;
- The maximum number of weapons in the inventory is limited to 5 (excluding equipment slots);
- Changed the system of interaction with objects, now when you press LMB, a menu of interactions will appear;
- Fixed animation when picking up weapons in inventory.

Patch 1.0.6 changelog:
  - Fixed a bug where the Halloween 1944 event did not end after killing the boss;
  - Added a loading screen for the Halloween 1944 event;
  - Added loading screen for "First Hit" mission;
  - Added a loading screen for the "Bir-Hakeim" mission;
